      "side": 1,
      "message": "We now have 3 HALs with a strikingly similar structure (time clock, shared secret, \u0026 this).\n\nDo we need so many APIs? Is there a way to make it generic?",
      "revId": "a0d9b01e42a9abfb9a414548ebf16901a7f8d5da",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cb4c313d_a74e5e57",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
